{"4033680":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Escape: Immersion","steam_appid":4033680,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4599870],"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4033680\/extras\/f8515d61457344ddb9839dfd2ed37bca.poster.avif?t=1791543761\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4033680\/extras\/f8515d61457344ddb9839dfd2ed37bca.webm?t=1791543761\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4033680\/extras\/f8515d61457344ddb9839dfd2ed37bca.mp4?t=1791543761\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a collapsing underwater military base. You don’t know who you are, or why you’re here. The only thing you do know — <i>time is running out.<\/i><\/p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steel creaks. Water breaks in. Shadows move in the dark corridors. Every corner hides danger, and every decision can be your last.<\/p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4033680\/extras\/558f019f83c1142446959603153b36ca.poster.avif?t=1791543761\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4033680\/extras\/558f019f83c1142446959603153b36ca.webm?t=1791543761\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4033680\/extras\/558f019f83c1142446959603153b36ca.mp4?t=1791543761\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Escape: Immersion<\/strong>, survival is about reacting fast, adapting, and pushing forward. The environment is unpredictable, the threats are real, and your past will haunt you.<\/p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4033680\/extras\/9b15134ac04e767f2a17b33c06d65f8a.poster.avif?t=1791543761\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4033680\/extras\/9b15134ac04e767f2a17b33c06d65f8a.webm?t=1791543761\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4033680\/extras\/9b15134ac04e767f2a17b33c06d65f8a.mp4?t=1791543761\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Classic linear adventure game<\/li><li>Unique VHS-styled visuals create an unfriendly, oppressive atmosphere<\/li><li>Intense gameplay full of dynamic and unpredictable events<\/li><li>Every mistake can be fatal — danger lurks at every step<\/li><li>A variety of situations and countless ways they can unfold<\/li><li>The base is almost completely absorbed by the ocean. Discover the secret of your past and try to escape before it’s too late<\/li><li>Water is not your worst enemy. Darkness hides more than you can imagine<\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4033680\/extras\/f8515d61457344ddb9839dfd2ed37bca.poster.avif?t=1791543761\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4033680\/extras\/f8515d61457344ddb9839dfd2ed37bca.webm?t=1791543761\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4033680\/extras\/f8515d61457344ddb9839dfd2ed37bca.mp4?t=1791543761\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a collapsing underwater military base. You don’t know who you are, or why you’re here. The only thing you do know — <i>time is running out.<\/i><\/p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steel creaks. Water breaks in. Shadows move in the dark corridors. Every corner hides danger, and every decision can be your last.<\/p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4033680\/extras\/558f019f83c1142446959603153b36ca.poster.avif?t=1791543761\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4033680\/extras\/558f019f83c1142446959603153b36ca.webm?t=1791543761\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4033680\/extras\/558f019f83c1142446959603153b36ca.mp4?t=1791543761\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Escape: Immersion<\/strong>, survival is about reacting fast, adapting, and pushing forward. The environment is unpredictable, the threats are real, and your past will haunt you.<\/p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4033680\/extras\/9b15134ac04e767f2a17b33c06d65f8a.poster.avif?t=1791543761\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4033680\/extras\/9b15134ac04e767f2a17b33c06d65f8a.webm?t=1791543761\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4033680\/extras\/9b15134ac04e767f2a17b33c06d65f8a.mp4?t=1791543761\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Classic linear adventure game<\/li><li>Unique VHS-styled visuals create an unfriendly, oppressive atmosphere<\/li><li>Intense gameplay full of dynamic and unpredictable events<\/li><li>Every mistake can be fatal — danger lurks at every step<\/li><li>A variety of situations and countless ways they can unfold<\/li><li>The base is almost completely absorbed by the ocean. Discover the secret of your past and try to escape before it’s too late<\/li><li>Water is not your worst enemy. Darkness hides more than you can imagine<\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Escape: Immersion is a cinematic 2.5D horror adventure set inside a collapsing underwater military base. Explore flooded corridors, solve environmental puzzles, evade deadly traps, and uncover your past.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, Russian, Azerbaijani<strong>*<\/strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Turkish, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese, Arabic, Czech, Dutch, Finnish, Hungarian, Indonesian, Norwegian, Romanian, Swedish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Georgian<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4033680\/1162b2fe206242e8dfc2971484bc6dc75197ec1e\/header.jpg?t=1791543761","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4033680\/4ae07037de007b975480a3ed136f6c3e3f0b6ab6\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1791543761","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4033680\/4ae07037de007b975480a3ed136f6c3e3f0b6ab6\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1791543761","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-2300 | AMD FX-4350<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 570, 1 GB | AMD Radeon HD 7850, 2 GB<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 8 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i7-3770 | AMD FX-8350<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 760, 2 GB | AMD Radeon HD 7870, 2 GB<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 8 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 11 Big Sur or later (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5 or Apple M1<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Metal-capable graphics: Intel Iris Plus \/ AMD Radeon Pro \/ Apple Silicon integrated GPU<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 10 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Core Audio-compatible sound device<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> 64-bit macOS required. Universal build supports Intel and Apple Silicon.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 13 Ventura or later (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i7 or Apple M1 or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Metal-capable dedicated GPU with 4 GB VRAM or Apple M1 or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 10 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Core Audio-compatible sound device<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> SSD recommended. Universal build supports Intel and Apple Silicon.<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS or later \/ SteamOS 3 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-2300 | AMD FX-4350<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Vulkan 1.1 or OpenGL 4.5 compatible GPU with 2 GB VRAM (NVIDIA GTX 760 \/ AMD Radeon HD 7870 or equivalent)<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 8 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> ALSA-compatible audio device<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> 64-bit OS required. Vulkan is recommended; OpenGL Core fallback is supported.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Ubuntu 22.04 LTS or later \/ SteamOS 3 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i7-3770 | AMD FX-8350<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Vulkan 1.1 compatible GPU with 4 GB VRAM (NVIDIA GTX 1060 \/ AMD Radeon RX 570 or equivalent)<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 8 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> ALSA-compatible audio device<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> 64-bit OS required. SSD and current graphics drivers are recommended.<\/li><\/ul>"},"developers":["AzDimension, Royal Games"],"publishers":["Royal Games"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":999,"final":999,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"$9.99"},"packages":[1415005],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Escape: Immersion","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1415005,"percent_savings_text":" ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Escape: Immersion - $9.99","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":999}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":true,"linux":true},"c